scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py), the owner's case:
# a loose bunch of 10, wider than deep (16 cells across, 8 deep), slow bodies mostly in front, Aramon Knights
# (fast 3x3, speed 2.9) and Swordsmen (slow 2x2, 1.10) mixed, sent with ONE right-click to one
# point about 600 px from the click's centre, as a player sends a mixed selection. Asset-free.
# Open field, move order.
name overtake-click-bunch-600
ticks 3000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 200
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S0 0 slow 1 cells 54,53
group S1 0 slow 1 cells 59,53
group S2 0 slow 1 cells 64,53
group F3 0 fast 1 cells 56,57
group F4 0 fast 1 cells 61,57
group S5 0 slow 1 cells 66,57
group F6 0 fast 1 cells 53,61
group S7 0 slow 1 cells 58,61
group F8 0 fast 1 cells 63,61
group F9 0 fast 1 cells 67,61
at 5 move S0,S1,S2,F3,F4,S5,F6,S7,F8,F9 60 20
